{
  "file_id": "ID03536",
  "text_count": 66,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "I see a cave! Let's take a break\nand rest in there!",
      "_offset": 3056,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Maybe Takeru's taking shelter\nthere!",
      "_offset": 3108,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Takeru's not here...",
      "_offset": 3145,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Yamato, I know you're in a hurry,\nbut you'll get a cold if we don't\nwait out the snowstorm.",
      "_offset": 3166,
      "_length": 91,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "I'm fine. You rest.",
      "_offset": 3258,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "I'll go look for Takeru! You\nshould wait here and rest.",
      "_offset": 3278,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Gabumon...",
      "_offset": 3334,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "I'm all right, I'm wearing fur!\nI'm going, so just wait here,\nokay?",
      "_offset": 3345,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Takeru! I can't just sit here!",
      "_offset": 3413,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Takeruuuuu!",
      "_offset": 3444,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "*cough, cough, cough, cough*",
      "_offset": 3456,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Takeru... Where are you?",
      "_offset": 3485,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "In the end, I couldn't find\nTakeru...\nAh! Yamato!",
      "_offset": 3510,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "It's so cold...His body's almost\nfrozen. If I don't do something,\nhe's gonna freeze to death.",
      "_offset": 3560,
      "_length": 93,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Looks like I'll have to use my\nfur. Nobody's looking, anyway...",
      "_offset": 3654,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "And so, Gabumon took off his fur\nand put it on Yamato, who was in\npain.",
      "_offset": 3718,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Nf...ah...",
      "_offset": 3790,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Are you okay? *whoosh*",
      "_offset": 3801,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Were you keeping me warm all this\ntime?",
      "_offset": 3824,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "*cough, cough, cough*\nHuh? That's weird...",
      "_offset": 3864,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "So you caught my cold instead? I'm\nsorry. But I feel a lot better.",
      "_offset": 3907,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "It's nothing! You're embarrassing\nme...",
      "_offset": 3974,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Heeeeeey, Yamato!",
      "_offset": 4014,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "I hear Taichi's voice!",
      "_offset": 4032,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Good job finding us!",
      "_offset": 4055,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "So what do we do now?",
      "_offset": 4076,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Isn't it obvious? We need to find\neveryone else!",
      "_offset": 4098,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Takeru! Answer me!",
      "_offset": 4147,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "They were probably blown away to\ndifferent islands, so calm down.",
      "_offset": 4166,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Takeru's waiting for me to find\nhim!",
      "_offset": 4232,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "We can't find them! But I bet\nthey're all doing just fine. Even\nTakeru!",
      "_offset": 4269,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Stop trying to comfort me...",
      "_offset": 4341,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Yamato...",
      "_offset": 4370,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Takeru! Everyone! Where are they?",
      "_offset": 4380,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Taichi! You've been staring off\ninto space. Why can't you bother\nhelping me look for everyone?",
      "_offset": 4418,
      "_length": 94,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "More importantly, Yamato, aren't\nyou worried about where this\nisland's going?",
      "_offset": 4513,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "\"More importantly\"?",
      "_offset": 4591,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Devimon said we might be headed to\nthe land on the other side of the\nocean...",
      "_offset": 4611,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Isn't finding everyone else more\nimportant?",
      "_offset": 4689,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "If we go there, maybe we'll find a\nway to find everyone!",
      "_offset": 4733,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "You don't understand how I feel,\nwhen Takeru's not here!",
      "_offset": 4790,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "What'd you just say? You...!",
      "_offset": 4847,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Stop it!",
      "_offset": 4876,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "This isn't the time to be\nfighting!",
      "_offset": 4885,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Yamato, you...!",
      "_offset": 4921,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Takeru can't do anything on his\nown!",
      "_offset": 4937,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Uwaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 4978,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "It's Mojyamon!",
      "_offset": 4991,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Whoa!",
      "_offset": 5006,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Yamato! Watch out!",
      "_offset": 5012,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "That was close! Are you okay,\nYamato?",
      "_offset": 5031,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Yeah, I'm fine.",
      "_offset": 5069,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "A black gear! He's being\nmanipulated by Devimon!",
      "_offset": 5085,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Hnyaaaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 5134,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Gyaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 5152,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "We did it!",
      "_offset": 5163,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Taichi, look! That broken wall has\nblack gears in it!",
      "_offset": 5174,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Those black gears are separating\nYamato and Takeru!\nFox Fire!",
      "_offset": 5228,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "What's going on?!",
      "_offset": 5290,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "The gears are turning backwards...",
      "_offset": 5308,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Guys, there's trouble! The\nisland's moving!",
      "_offset": 5343,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Really?",
      "_offset": 5387,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "You're right! We're going back to\nInfinity Mountain!",
      "_offset": 5395,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Maybe Takeru will be there too...",
      "_offset": 5448,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Yeah, I'm sure of it!",
      "_offset": 5482,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Wait for me, Takeru...!",
      "_offset": 5504,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}